The MVP must include:

1. User registration and login.
2. Debit and cash accounts.
3. Income and expense tracking.
4. Categories.
5. Credit card management.
6. Card-level interest configuration.
7. Multi-currency credit card balances in COP and USD.
8. Single-installment and multi-installment purchases.
